{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……蛤？初體驗失敗了？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0621", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想死的心都有了……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂喂喂，等一下，是發生了什麼事失敗？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0622", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼？摩擦大腿就射……嗯嗯嗯！？」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0623", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗哈！突然蓋住我的嘴，是想跟我傳誹聞嗎？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0624", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你沒必要重複吧，大腿什麼的。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，抱歉抱歉。不過，那還真是災難欸。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0625", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一般人聽了都覺得很好笑吧……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0626", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，我因為自己太丟臉晚上也睡不著。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "現在我後悔找隼太商量這件事了。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒想到自己有一天會淪落到讓人瞧不起的男人的最底層……", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊大概也討厭我了。現在不是考試的時候了……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……天羽學姊會因為那種事就討厭你嗎？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0627", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是不會笑你啦。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0628", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你想想。對方是你真心喜歡上的人吧？」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0629", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟那種色情漫畫裡的姊姊是不同的。忍耐不住不是當然的嗎？」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0630", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且對方還是那個天羽學姊欸！那當然摩擦大腿就會想射……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0631", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉。總之，我覺得是你想太多了。」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0632", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太說的也有道理。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊可愛過頭，甚至道犯罪等級了。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，天羽學姊有對你說什麼嗎？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0633", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她說我可愛，摸了我的頭。」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在初體驗失敗後？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0634", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼嘛，虧我還認真替你擔心。」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0635", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，一定沒有下次了吧。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那下次就把表現拿出來啊。啊～啊，結果只是來放閃的喔，真是的……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 360, "voice": "ht0636", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不能就這樣依賴學姊的溫柔。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "下次……下次我絕對──！", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，學姊……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 1, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1578", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用摸我的也沒關係……」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 3, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……摸的話會痛嗎？」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1579", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不會，非常舒服……」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 5, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像這樣摸的話，會像昨天那樣咻咻射出來嗎？」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1580", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「會射出來……大概，噗嚕嚕嚕的。」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 7, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1581", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "發誓要雪恥，我再次回到了這個場所。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我積極地親吻她、營造氣氛，我應該已經跟昨天以前的自己說再見了。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 11, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣下去，會噗嚕嚕嚕的？」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1582", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 13, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「噗嚕嚕嚕的話，新吾君會舒服吧？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1583", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "龜頭被溫柔地撫摸，我忍不住叫出聲。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「變得好大……男人變成這種狀態，要怎麼說呢？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1584", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳是說像現在一樣變大？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 18, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1585", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，叫做勃起。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 20, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「勃起……這叫做勃起啊。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1586", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊稍微用力握住根部，像是想確認莖身的硬度。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊，不用管我的……」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾君的頂端，好像剛剝好的水煮蛋。光溜溜的、濕濕的……」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1587", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊……」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像這樣摸頂端舒服嗎？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1588", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「舒、舒服是舒服……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 27, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1589", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她小心翼翼的動作，讓我異常興奮。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "伸進學姊內褲裡的手，已經完全靜止下來了。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自衛就已經費盡心力，我沒辦法繼續挑逗她。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，這麼可愛的人……居然還沒有長毛。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不行，光是想像就快要射精了。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結子小姐，妳怎麼生下了這麼驚人的女孩啊。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "近距離下看起來，她明明是個很美麗的姊姊。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……卻光溜溜的。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男人不是隨時都在勃起的吧？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1590", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，因為學姊像這樣摸我，所以才興奮得勃起了。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……被其他女孩子摸也會勃起嗎？」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1591", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，這個……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就男人的體質來說，無法肯定說不會。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 41, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺好討厭喔……被其他的女孩子摸也會勃起……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1592", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「應該說，我沒有被其他女孩子摸過。今後也不會讓別人摸。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 43, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那能讓新吾君變大的人就只有我囉？」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1593", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳說的沒錯……唔唔！？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊歪著頭，手伸向陰囊，用手指撫摸著。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「皺皺的袋子……男人身上有這樣的東西啊。這裡摸起來好涼喔……」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1594", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她的手掌托起玩弄，莖身又變得更大了。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "脹得好像要爆裂一樣，連我自己都害怕。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 49, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉喔。擅自摸了……」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1595", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼。變得比剛才更有精神了呢……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1596", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的手往上移動，開始輕輕地揉起龜頭。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的動作漸漸大膽，摩擦力也越來越強。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 55, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然這個頂端很舒服啊……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1597", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的手就像在操作汽車的排檔桿一樣，同時還注視著我的臉。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒辦法反抗她。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊的一隻右手就掌控了我。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 59, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君，不用忍耐沒關係喔……？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1598", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 61, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男人舒服的時候會……射精？對吧？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1599", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "射精這個詞，從美羽學姊口中說出來實在太性感了。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管是交配也好、射精也好，我的NG詞彙未免也太多了。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我想試試看讓新吾君射精。」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1600", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 66, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天，你在我的肚子上咻咻出來了對吧？就像那樣讓新吾君……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1601", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊、美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 68, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，可以喔。我會一直給新吾君的摸摸。頂端對吧？新吾君的這個頂端……」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1602", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊啊！？」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊移動手腕摩擦整個龜頭，她的呼吸也開始急促。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被學姊小小的手掌包裹，我的傢伙變得更硬，翹起到肚臍的位置。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這樣下去，我就沒辦法克制自己了。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊像在擦電燈泡一樣，用手掌抵著龜頭摩擦。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 74, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以射精喔……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1603", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我耳邊低語。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我咬緊牙關忍耐，但是在學姊越來越熟練的手法下，我還是忍不住了。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊、學姊、要射了……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 78, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，射出來吧。在我的手裡射精吧。」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1604", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔！？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 80, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀！？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1605", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 81, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……啊……出來了……新吾君的……怎麼辦、怎麼辦……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1606", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 82, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君還好嗎？一抖一抖的……啊、啊、好厲害……噴出來了……」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1607", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊、學姊……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我靠在學姊身上，胯下頂住她的手掌。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像身在夢中一樣舒服。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊在我射精的瞬間握住龜頭，承接了熱燙的濁流。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1608", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，射出來了。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 89, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這就是……射精……？因為剛才那樣讓新吾君舒服嗎？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1609", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊……好熱喔。而且黏稠稠的……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1610", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊用不可思議的表情凝視著手掌上沾到的精液。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，學姊……」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 94, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1611", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 96, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀！？」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1612", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我強勢地把她抱上床，然後壓在她身上。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊……美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜歡她的心情太強烈，我的身軀不自覺緊繃。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 100, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、新吾君……呀、嗯、啊、啊啊……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1613", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忘我地抱著學姊，明明沒有插入卻不斷挺腰。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我剛才沒有確認插入的位置，只是用自己的傢伙摩擦學姊的裂縫。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啊哈啊、美羽學姊、我喜歡妳……最喜歡妳……」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 104, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我也是……喜歡新吾君、最喜歡……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1614", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咕、美羽學姊……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這樣，美羽學姊的腳勾上我的腰的瞬間──", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、新吾君……等一下、出來了！新吾君你射出來了喔！」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1615", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己都沒有發現。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二次的射精實在來得太快，我連藉口都想不出來。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊一臉寂寞地看著我丟臉射出來的精液。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 113, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、不行，不要離開！」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1616", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被學姊一把抱住，我只能別無選擇地把臉埋入她的乳房。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好想哭。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道美羽學姊是想安慰我。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 118, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要露出那種表情。」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1617", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是我……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 120, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾君很努力了喔。這一點我最清楚不過了……」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1618", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真的很抱歉。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然覺得丟臉，但還是忍不住向學姊撒嬌。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊的身體為什麼會如此溫暖呢？", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個人的聲音讓我好放鬆……", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 125, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是好困擾呢……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1619", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 127, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「拼命挺腰的新吾君實在太可愛了。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1620", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 128, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像會就這樣再也不放開你呢。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1621", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……這是在誇我嗎？", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 130, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，下次還要讓我看可愛的挺腰喔♪」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 347, "voice": "mu1622", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、我會加油的。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_09.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_02", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天，我又被這個人的笑容給救贖了。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
